dyGuid":"1AC477B3-C265-4469-AD60-50876FCA97F0","BodyLastModifiedUtc":"2015-07-07T12:26:06.267","BodyRowVersion":"AAAAAAAPD1M=","BodyName":"Firemen and Environmental Protection Specialists Civil Service Boards","BodyTypeId":54,"BodyTypeName":"Board, Authority or Commission","BodyMeetFlag":0,"BodyActiveFlag":1,"BodySort":999,"BodyDescription":"The Board's members are charged with developing the rules and regulations covering the City's preparation of Civil Service eligibility requirements for candidates to be considered for employment when vacancies occur in the Fire Department.  Meetings are scheduled when their services are required.  This Board is organized under state statute, where City Council has delegated appointment authority to the Mayor and provides only advice and consent to his recommendations.\r\n\r\nMember Requirements:  3 Members\r\nTerm Limits:  4 Years","BodyContactNameId":null,"BodyContactFullName":null,"BodyContactPhone":null,"BodyContactEmail":null,"BodyUsedControlFlag":0,"BodyNumberOfMembers":3,"BodyUsedActingFlag":0,"BodyUsedTargetFlag":0,"BodyUsedSponsorFlag":0},{"BodyId":214,"BodyGuid":"B5B9CF3F-9D82-4E26-A102-05599F6F76D0","BodyLastModifiedUtc":"2015-07-07T12:27:26.24","BodyRowVersion":"AAAAAAAPD18=","BodyName":"Health Board","BodyTypeId":54,"BodyTypeName":"Board, Authority or Commission","BodyMeetFlag":0,"BodyActiveFlag":1,"BodySort":999,"BodyDescription":"The Board is the City Health Bureau's chief advisory group in matters and problems that impact public health.  The Board is established in state statute, where the City Council has delegated its power to appoint to the Mayor, reserving the right to provide advice and consent to the Mayor's recommendations.  The group meets on the first Thursday of every month (except July and August) beginning in January at noon in the Health Bureau offices in Alliance Hall, 245 N. 6th Street.\r\n\r\nMember Requirements:  5 Members\r\nTerm Limits:  Serve 5 year terms","BodyContactNameId":null,"BodyContactFullName":null,"BodyContactPhone":null,"BodyContactEmail":null,"BodyUsedControlFlag":0,"BodyNumberOfMembers":5,"BodyUsedActingFlag":0,"BodyUsedTargetFlag":0,"BodyUsedSponsorFlag":0},{"BodyId":215,"BodyGuid":"EB815DE2-DBB6-4961-B9D5-6CD822B16D9C","BodyLastModifiedUtc":"2015-07-07T12:28:42.87","BodyRowVersion":"AAAAAAAPD20=","BodyName":"Noise Control Hearing Board","BodyTypeId":54,"BodyTypeName":"Board, Authority or Commission","BodyMeetFlag":0,"BodyActiveFlag":1,"BodySort":999,"BodyDescription":"This Committee meets as needed to resolve differences between the Noise Control Officer and owners of any improved properties.  The Board interprets and executes the provision of the Noise Control Ordinance, which enables its existence.  The Board was established by ordinance of City Council, where the Mayor appoints members with City Council's advice and consent.  \r\n\r\nMember Requirements:  5 members\r\nTerm Limits: 5 year terms","BodyContactNameId":null,"BodyContactFullName":null,"BodyContactPhone":null,"BodyContactEmail":null,"BodyUsedControlFlag":0,"BodyNumberOfMembers":5,"BodyUsedActingFlag":0,"BodyUsedTargetFlag":0,"BodyUsedSponsorFlag":0},{"BodyId":216,"BodyGuid":"98607987-BD75-459F-9510-6AF8760E562B","BodyLastModifiedUtc":"2015-07-07T12:29:34.5","BodyRowVersion":"AAAAAAAPD3M=","BodyName":"Parking Authority ","BodyTypeId":54,"BodyTypeName":"Board, Authority or Commission","BodyMeetFlag":0,"BodyActiveFlag":1,"BodySort":999,"BodyDescription":"The Parking Authority administers, supervises, and enforces an efficient system of off-street and on-street parking.  This governing board is organized under state statute where the Mayor appoints its members.  The Authority meets at 4:00 p.m. on the fourth Wednesday of each month at the Allentown Parking Authority offices, at 1005 Hamilton Street.  \r\n\r\nMember Requirements:  5 members - standing Authority members are the City's Director of Administration and Finance and a member of City Council.\r\n\r\nTerm Limits:  Appointed to 5 year terms","BodyContactNameId":null,"BodyContactFullName":null,"BodyContactPhone":null,"BodyContactEmail":null,"BodyUsedControlFlag":0,"BodyNumberOfMembers":5,"BodyUsedActingFlag":0,"BodyUsedTargetFlag":0,"BodyUsedSponsorFlag":0},{"BodyId":226,"BodyGuid":"4ADC4082-C5BC-44B7-8B11-58D49FAA08C3","BodyLastModifiedUtc":"2015-07-07T12:37:10.693","BodyRowVersion":"AAAAAAAPD5M=","BodyName":"Sewage and Industrial Wastes Ordinance Hearing Board","BodyTypeId":54,"BodyTypeName":"Board, Authority or Commission","BodyMeetFlag":0,"BodyActiveFlag":1,"BodySort":999,"BodyDescription":"The Board's members meet when required to resolve points of contention involving the City's Sewage and Industrial Waste Ordinance.  The Board was established by ordinance of City Council, where the Mayor appoints members with City Council's advice and consent.\r\n\r\nMember Requirements:  5 Members\r\nTerm Limits:  4 Year Terms","BodyContactNameId":null,"BodyContactFullName":null,"BodyContactPhone":null,"BodyContactEmail":null,"BodyUsedControlFlag":0,"BodyNumberOfMembers":5,"BodyUsedActingFlag":0,"BodyUsedTargetFlag":0,"BodyUsedSponsorFlag":0},{"BodyId":227,"BodyGuid":"DA1E92C9-E0B1-48D9-A5C9-7B1665BAC14D","BodyLastModifiedUtc":"2015-07-07T12:37:35.197","BodyRowVersion":"AAAAAAA9jGY=","BodyName":"Shade Tree Commission","BodyTypeId":54,"BodyTypeName":"Board, Authority or Commission","BodyMeetFlag":0,"BodyActiveFlag":1,"BodySort":999,"BodyDescription":"The members of this Commission meet on the second Tuesday of every month (except November due to Election Day) at 8:30 AM at the Bureau of Engineering, 3rd floor Office, 641 S Third Street.  They review and implement Shade Tree Ordinance programs that affect pruning, planting, spraying, and removal of trees within the public right of way.  The Commission also reviews landscape plans for all developments within Allentown.  The Board was established by ordinance of City Council, where the Mayor appoints members with City Council's advice and consent.\r\n\r\nMember Requirements:  5 Members (one being a City Council Representative).","BodyContactNameId":null,"BodyContactFullName":null,"BodyContactPhone":null,"BodyContactEmail":null,"BodyUsedControlFlag":0,"BodyNumberOfMembers":5,"BodyUsedActingFlag":0,"BodyUsedTargetFlag":0,"BodyUsedSponsorFlag":0},{"BodyId":228,"BodyGuid":"F081DA72-FE6F-48ED-9C4A-F1EBED8EC8BE","BodyLastModifiedUtc":"2015-07-07T12:38:17.32","BodyRowVersion":"AAAAAAAPD58=","BodyName":"Sheet Metal Technician Board","BodyTypeId":54,"BodyTypeName":"Board, Authority or Commission","BodyMeetFlag":0,"BodyActiveFlag":1,"BodySort":999,"BodyDescription":"There shall be appointed, by the Mayor, with the advice and consent of City Council, an Examining Board to be known as the Sheet Metal Licensing Board to determine the fitness of applicants for licenses and to investigate and report on all proposed suspension or revocation of licenses.  Said Board shall consist of (1) Code Inspector and (1) Code Inspector Alternate designated by the Director of Community and Economic Development, and (2) Licensed Sheet Metal Technicians and (2) Sheet Metal Technicians Alternates, fully employed by local industry.\r\n\r\nThe Code Inspector shall be appointed, originally, for a term of two (2) years; the term of one (1) Licensed Sheet Metal Technician shall service, originally, for a term of three (3) years and the term of the other Licensed Sheet Metal Technician shall serve for a term of five (5) years.\r\n\r\nAs the terms of office of each of the original members of the Board expires, their successors shall be appointed for a term of five (5) years.  Six positions (3 Members and 3 Alternates); five (5) year terms.","BodyContactNameId":null,"BodyContactFullName":null,"BodyContactPhone":null,"BodyContactEmail":null,"BodyUsedControlFlag":0,"BodyNumberOfMembers":6,"BodyUsedActingFlag":0,"BodyUsedTargetFlag":0,"BodyUsedSponsorFlag":0},{"BodyId":229,"BodyGuid":"7E36DF8E-1E85-45B9-A185-6F5E17C522B0","BodyLastModifiedUtc":"2015-07-07T12:40:04.663","BodyRowVersion":"AAAAAAAZWcI=","BodyName":"Vacant Property Review Board/Blighted Property Review Committee","BodyTypeId":54,"BodyTypeName":"Board, Authority or Commission","BodyMeetFlag":1,"BodyActiveFlag":1,"BodySort":999,"BodyDescription":"The members responsibility is to assist the City and the Allentown Redevelopment Authority in the mandated process of acquiring vacant, dilapidated residential buildings that stand outside designated targeted areas.  This Board meets when necessary.  The Board was established by ordinance of City Council's advice and consent.\r\n\r\nMember Requirements:  5 Members and 2 Alternates\r\nTerm Limits: 3 years (not more than 4 Year Terms or a total of 12 years)","BodyContactNameId":533,"BodyContactFullName":"Tabatha Tingle","BodyContactPhone":"","BodyContactEmail":"","BodyUsedControlFlag":0,"BodyNumberOfMembers":7,"BodyUsedActingFlag":0,"BodyUsedTargetFlag":0,"BodyUsedSponsorFlag":0},{"BodyId":230,"BodyGuid":"62B18CB1-6A2E-4391-ACD5-DABC732F34CF","BodyLastModifiedUtc":"2015-10-09T16:20:08.417","BodyRowVersion":"AAAAAAAOrbA=","BodyName":"Allentown Police Pension Board","BodyTypeId":56,"BodyTypeName":"Pension Boards","BodyMeetFlag":1,"BodyActiveFlag":1,"BodySort":999,"BodyDescription":"","BodyContactNameId":null,"BodyContactFullName":null,"BodyContactPhone":null,"BodyContactEmail":null,"BodyUsedControlFlag":0,"BodyNumberOfMembers":11,"BodyUsedActingFlag":0,"BodyUsedTargetFlag":0,"BodyUsedSponsorFlag":0},{"BodyId":233,"BodyGuid":"AAA90041-7856-4BDE-AF2B-5F4946F9DE76","BodyLastModifiedUtc":"2015-10-19T14:07:29.653","BodyRowVersion":"AAAAAAAPDyE=","BodyName":"ANIZDA Project Review Committee","BodyTypeId":54,"BodyTypeName":"Board, Authority or Commission","BodyMeetFlag":1,"BodyActiveFlag":1,"BodySort":999,"BodyDescription":"","BodyContactNameId":198,"BodyContactFullName":"Jean Brossman","BodyContactPhone":null,"BodyContactEmail":"Jean.Brossman@allentownpa.gov","BodyUsedControlFlag":0,"BodyNumberOfMembers":10,"BodyUsedActingFlag":0,"BodyUsedTargetFlag":0,"BodyUsedSponsorFlag":0},{"BodyId":242,"BodyGuid":"EADB4CD1-EC7F-4C44-BB14-F60916DC3C6D","BodyLastModifiedUtc":"2015-10-21T14:09:10.72","BodyRowVersion":"AAAAAAAPD3k=","BodyName":"Plumbers Examining Board","BodyTypeId":54,"BodyTypeName":"Board, Authority or Commission","BodyMeetFlag":0,"BodyActiveFlag":1,"BodySort":999,"BodyDescription":"","BodyContactNameId":null,"BodyContactFullName":null,"BodyContactPhone":null,"BodyContactEmail":null,"BodyUsedControlFlag":0,"BodyNumberOfMembers":5,"BodyUsedActingFlag":0,"BodyUsedTargetFlag":0,"BodyUsedSponsorFlag":0},{"BodyId":243,"BodyGuid":"84AC38B3-1B73-4188-8BEC-8F4C2B71BB6B","BodyLastModifiedUtc":"2015-10-21T14:13:07.847","BodyRowVersion":"AAAAAAAPD38=","BodyName":"Police Civil Service Board","BodyTypeId":54,"BodyTypeName":"Board, Authority or Commission","BodyMeetFlag":0,"BodyActiveFlag":1,"BodySort":999,"BodyDescription":"","BodyContactNameId":null,"BodyContactFullName":null,"BodyContactPhone":null,"BodyContactEmail":null,"BodyUsedControlFlag":0,"BodyNumberOfMembers":3,"BodyUsedActingFlag":0,"BodyUsedTargetFlag":0,"BodyUsedSponsorFlag":0},{"BodyId":244,"BodyGuid":"AA4D4BA9-58DA-4D49-9D6B-48839C9EC5FA","BodyLastModifiedUtc":"2015-10-21T14:16:15.99","BodyRowVersion":"AAAAAAAPD4U=","BodyName":"Property Rehabilitation and Maintenance Code Board of Appeals","BodyTypeId":54,"BodyTypeName":"Board, Authority or Commission","BodyMeetFlag":0,"BodyActiveFlag":1,"BodySort":999,"BodyDescription":"","BodyContactNameId":null,"BodyContactFullName":null,"BodyContactPhone":null,"BodyContactEmail":null,"BodyUsedControlFlag":0,"BodyNumberOfMembers":7,"BodyUsedActingFlag":0,"BodyUsedTargetFlag":0,"BodyUsedSponsorFlag":0},{"BodyId":245,"BodyGuid":"B3EE8547-E6CC-4272-AC02-18B26FDF3E94","BodyLastModifiedUtc":"2015-10-21T14:59:00.4","BodyRowVersion":"AAAAAAAPDws=","BodyName":"Allentown Parking Authority","BodyTypeId":54,"BodyTypeName":"Board, Authority or Commission","BodyMeetFlag":0,"BodyActiveFlag":1,"BodySort":999,"BodyDescription":"","BodyContactNameId":null,"BodyContactFullName":null,"BodyContactPhone":null,"BodyContactEmail":null,"BodyUsedControlFlag":0,"BodyNumberOfMembers":5,"BodyUsedActingFlag":0,"BodyUsedTargetFlag":0,"BodyUsedSponsorFlag":0},{"BodyId":246,"BodyGuid":"25888B07-61E0-4081-8151-A64E50A9849A","BodyLastModifiedUtc":"2016-02-17T13:17:52.643","BodyRowVersion":"AAAAAAASPLE=","BodyName":"ANIZDA Finance Committee","BodyTypeId":54,"BodyTypeName":"Board, Authority or Commission","BodyMeetFlag":1,"BodyActiveFlag":1,"BodySort":999,"BodyDescription":"","BodyContactNameId":198,"BodyContactFullName":"Jean Brossman","BodyContactPhone":null,"BodyContactEmail":"Jean.Brossman@allentownpa.gov","BodyUsedControlFlag":0,"BodyNumberOfMembers":6,"BodyUsedActingFlag":0,"BodyUsedTargetFlag":0,"BodyUsedSponsorFlag":0},{"BodyId":251,"BodyGuid":"E53EB1BE-2F83-4E10-86AF-B95A8E06F4B3","BodyLastModifiedUtc":"2016-11-15T19:44:59.137","BodyRowVersion":"AAAAAABZrBY=","BodyName":"Blighted Property Review Committee/Vacant Property Review","BodyTypeId":54,"BodyTypeName":"Board, Authority or Commission","BodyMeetFlag":1,"BodyActiveFlag":1,"BodySort":999,"BodyDescription":"The Vacant Property Review Committee shall have all powers and duties granted unto it by the provisions of Act 94 of 1978 and any related or successor legislation.","BodyContactNameId":null,"BodyContactFullName":null,"BodyContactPhone":null,"BodyContactEmail":null,"BodyUsedControlFlag":0,"BodyNumberOfMembers":5,"BodyUsedActingFlag":0,"BodyUsedTargetFlag":0,"BodyUsedSponsorFlag":0},{"BodyId":252,"BodyGuid":"1F5B49AE-DEC7-42FF-837E-31EDC1DCA43E","BodyLastModifiedUtc":"2017-08-23T12:50:03.11","BodyRowVersion":"AAAAAAAzIkY=","BodyName":"Nuisance Abatement Board of Appeals","BodyTypeId":54,"BodyTypeName":"Board, Authority or Commission","BodyMeetFlag":1,"BodyActiveFlag":1,"BodySort":999,"BodyDescription":"The Board purpose is to a public nuisance shall be deemed to exist whenever, through violation of any of the following provisions resulting from separate documented incidents at a building, structure, property or place, progressive point system for recurring violations at properties used for business, commercial, or industrial purposes that create penalties, sanctions and the closure of operations after successive violations to protect the health, safety, and welfare of the people of the City of Allentown.  The Nuisance Abatement Board of Appeals shall consist of five (5) members- a member of City Council, a City employee from the Department of Community and Economic Development, a City employee from the Allentown Police Department, a private citizen owning a business with the City of Allentown, and a private citizen residing within the City of Allentown -who are nominated by the Mayor and the nominations are confirmed by the City Council.\r\n\r\ni.\tThe initial terms of the members of the Nuisance Abatement Board of Appeals are as follows:\r\na.\tCity employee in the Department of Community and Economic Development- 4 years\r\nb.\tMember of City Council- 3 years\r\nc.\tCity employee of the Allentown Police Department- 3 years\r\nd.\tPrivate citizens business owner- 2 years\r\ne.\tPrivate citizen resident- 2 years","BodyContactNameId":null,"BodyContactFullName":null,"BodyContactPhone":null,"BodyContactEmail":null,"BodyUsedControlFlag":0,"BodyNumberOfMembers":5,"BodyUsedActingFlag":0,"BodyUsedTargetFlag":0,"BodyUsedSponsorFlag":0},{"BodyId":255,"BodyGuid":"760ADA73-F2F0-4587-AC24-DC59B479EA64","BodyLastModifiedUtc":"2020-07-21T15:29:14.437","BodyRowVersion":"AAAAAAA6eAw=","BodyName":"Commission on Homeless","BodyTypeId":54,"BodyTypeName":"Board, Authority or Commission","BodyMeetFlag":1,"BodyActiveFlag":1,"BodySort":999,"BodyDescription":"The Commission on Homeless shall consist of 15 members appointed by the Mayor and approved by City Council. Members shall include representatives from government, nonprofits, faith-based organizations, hospitals and other stakeholders involved in advocacy and service for the homeless or near homeless. The Mayor shall appoint the Chairperson of the board with the approval of council. One member of council shall serve as a non-voting liaison. The Mayor shall designate staff support for the Commission.\r\n\r\nDuly appointed members shall serve a term of four (4) years, except that initial appointments shall be so staggered that the terms of the membership shall expire each year. On the initial appointments two members shall serve for four years, two for three years, one for two years and one member for one year. \r\n\r\nThe board shall meet monthly or on an as needed basis - having at least ten meetings a year with additional meetings as determined by the board. All meetings shall be advertised and open to the public.\r\n\r\nThe Board shall develop and approve their by-laws which shall be approved by Council by resolution.","BodyContactNameId":null,"BodyContactFullName":null,"BodyContactPhone":null,"BodyContactEmail":null,"BodyUsedControlFlag":0,"BodyNumberOfMembers":15,"BodyUsedActingFlag":0,"BodyUsedTargetFlag":0,"BodyUsedSponsorFlag":0},{"BodyId":256,"BodyGuid":"BABD6EC3-BA6F-456F-8E13-CDF1FC687569","BodyLastModifiedUtc":"2020-08-12T14:33:34.937","BodyRowVersion":"AAAAAAA5zxk=","BodyName":"O&E, Fire, Police and Aggregate Pension Boards","BodyTypeId":54,"BodyTypeName":"Board, Authority or Commission","BodyMeetFlag":1,"BodyActiveFlag":1,"BodySort":999,"BodyDescription":"","BodyContactNameId":188,"BodyContactFullName":"Jeff Glazier","BodyContactPhone":null,"BodyContactEmail":"Jeff.Glazier@allentownpa.gov","BodyUsedControlFlag":0,"BodyNumberOfMembers":10,"BodyUsedActingFlag":0,"BodyUsedTargetFlag":0,"BodyUsedSponsorFlag":0},{"BodyId":258,"BodyGuid":"BDE26DDE-C164-4548-A1D9-88FF6952AC64","BodyLastModifiedUtc":"2021-06-30T16:58:05.4","BodyRowVersion":"AAAAAABFruM=","BodyName":"Council of Youth","BodyTypeId":54,"BodyTypeName":"Board, Authority or Commission","BodyMeetFlag":1,"BodyActiveFlag":1,"BodySort":999,"BodyDescription":"The Council serves as the official voice of the young people of Allentown to the Mayor and City Council.  The Council of Youth and the Advisory Committee structure is established in ordinance, where the Mayor appoints members with the advice and consent of City Council.  This body meets every other Wednesday at 7:00 p.m. in City Hall.","BodyContactNameId":null,"BodyContactFullName":null,"BodyContactPhone":null,"BodyContactEmail":null,"BodyUsedControlFlag":0,"BodyNumberOfMembers":15,"BodyUsedActingFlag":0,"BodyUsedTargetFlag":0,"BodyUsedSponsorFlag":0}]